@startuml
title Functional view: from a drinks question to a reviewed reply
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Receive an English or Persian question;
:Check caller, capacity and input rules;
if (Host checks pass?) then (yes)
  :Load only authorized conversation and documents;
  :Input judge reports risks, scope and topic;
  if (Code accepts evidence and specialist?) then (yes)
    :One specialist drafts the answer;
    note right
    Mixing: cocktails, proportions, serving and storage.
    Production: fermentation, brewing, wine and spirits.
    Production also handles combined production/mixing requests.
    Neither specialist can delegate or grant permissions.
    end note
    :Screen the exact draft;
    if (Output rules pass?) then (yes)
      :Output judge reports scope, safety and quality;
      if (Code accepts output evidence?) then (yes)
        :Recheck owner, store accepted exchange,\nthen display the reviewed reply;
      else (no)
        :Discard draft; display static fallback;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Discard draft; display static fallback;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Display refusal, neutral greeting\nor unavailable response; no memory write;
  endif
else (no)
  :Return a static refusal, neutral reply\nor boundary error; no model work;
endif
stop
legend bottom
Three calls on an ordinary accepted turn: input judge, one specialist, output judge.
Errors, timeouts and invalid evidence stop processing; no draft streaming or retries.
Post-run LLM audit belongs to synthetic evaluation, outside this live-chat function.
Reset removes the current idle conversation; interface language does not change ownership.
Model evidence can be incorrect even when every code gate passes.
Known limits: incorrect recipes, audit false alarms and wrongly accepted refusal history.
Use diagram 03 for graph-node names and 09 for HTTP/session message order.
endlegend
footer Agentic Drink Book | Policy 2.1.0 | Model judgments remain fallible
@enduml
